{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "To feel valued", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.7, "confidence_raw": 0.7, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I've been feeling pretty alone since moving out last week.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 58}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "How do people cope when their routines suddenly change like this?", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 164}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Every time I try something new, I think about what we used to do together.", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "I'm worried about reaching out to strangers. Plus, I miss the closeness of our bond.", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I've tried to pick up some hobbies, but without her around, it feels different.", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I miss those dinners we used to have. It feels like I lost a piece of my routine.", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 104}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Thinking about those times makes me sad, but it also reminds me of good memories.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 81}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "Those games were a way to keep our bond strong. Even apart, we felt connected through laughter and competition. It’s hard to replicate that now.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 144}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It feels strange here without her around.", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 95}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "The food was good, but the laughter felt off.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Now they just highlight how different everything feels.", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 114}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It usually feels good to help, but this time it didn't.", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 158}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It feels strange and a bit sad. I wish we were closer still.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "The distance feels big, especially after all the years we've been close.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 72}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Sometimes I just need to remember that.", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 112}, {"session_id": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But it's comforting to know she appreciates the help.", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 72}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261012T152204Z", "last_updated_at": "20261012T153854Z", "first_seen_session": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000881-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 4}
